  "description": "[Gorgeous, Obsessive, Affectionate Top ‘Cheongseon’ X Big, Potato, Innocent Bottom ‘Mokhun’]\n\nMokhun, a recessive omega with a long string of failed relationships, is devastated when he hears that the coworker he had a crush on is getting married. To make matters worse, a sudden heat hits him, leading to a frantic one-night stand with an alpha who is a complete stranger to him.\n\nLater, when his one-night partner Cheongseon reaches out, Mokhun nervously agrees to meet up. Instead of brushing things off, Cheongseon casually drops a shocking confession claiming that night was the best experience he’s ever had, one that could never be topped...\n\n*“I... want to bond with you.”*\n\n*“I don’t get it... Cheongseon is a dominant alpha on a completely different level from me... Why would someone like him choose someone as ordinary as me?”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082251)",
